    {
      "id": "u_96095304040a40f866aa6eec_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To insert a new footnote, open the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Insert__TRILIUM_PH_2__ menu of the __TRILIUM_PH_3__Formatting toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_4__ and choose __TRILIUM_PH_5__ __TRILIUM_PH_6__Footnote__TRILIUM_PH_7__ (or select __TRILIUM_PH_8__New footnote__TRILIUM_PH_9__ in its submenu).",
      "sourceHash": "96095304040a40f866aa6eeca9c3d7ed320fe30aec0d3d6fc0b9654514462e12",
      "context": "Footnotes > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "4add2d50b766d12b9fb1e8537dab8287b12f93989038200a3afb9ff53b11685c",
