      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1ee7bb9a10ab04d77d3d23e1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To insert a reference to an existing footnote, open the submenu of __TRILIUM_PH_0__Footnote__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Insert footnote__TRILIUM_PH_3__, followed by the number of the footnote to insert.",
      "sourceHash": "1ee7bb9a10ab04d77d3d23e12be477c8c3ec31185365d18b63e7537a3c93f088",
      "context": "Footnotes > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "4add2d50b766d12b9fb1e8537dab8287b12f93989038200a3afb9ff53b11685c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b5b7e7307dd21020477d3440_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Hovering over a reference (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_0__) will display the content of the footnote in a tooltip for easy reference.",
      "sourceHash": "b5b7e7307dd21020477d3440c31f963a89e334c6aac64c9b964f914ecad4907b",
      "context": "Footnotes > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "4add2d50b766d12b9fb1e8537dab8287b12f93989038200a3afb9ff53b11685c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7b980d2460bc68c19f10b27e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking on a reference in the text (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_0__) will navigate to the corresponding footnote.",
      "sourceHash": "7b980d2460bc68c19f10b27eae5b4eb1dc7ed8722bbc3d45c9d295ad9e22baf5",
      "context": "Footnotes > Interaction",
